# Gimnasio Tierra (C8, contract 51), 17 x 21, interior. column = i, row = j. The user's approved mock "Gimnasio Tierra" (tools/c6_mock.py TIERRA): BIG light SANDSTONE slabs (2 x 2 tiles:
# `sslab_<i%2><j%2>`, never small tiles), rocks, boulders and pillars on them, the two back sides walled. The hall is a ROCK MAZE of five barrier rows (j = 16, 13, 10, 7, 4) across the whole width with ONE 2-cell gap each, alternately
# on the left (i = 2..3) and on the right (i = 13..14), posts (pillars) on both sides of every gap: the way is a serpentine, 2-wide lanes between the barriers (no spinner arrows: they read badly on the light slabs). The seven
# disciples stand IN the barrier rows (a niche between two rocks) facing SW (+j, a world axis: their art is the static 8-direction one) down the lane below them: a hero walking the lane crosses their column at distance 1..2 (range 3;
# the hall's guard 4) and is seen; the beaten one has walked at most one step out of his niche and a lane is two cells wide, so a beaten fighter never closes the way. DIRECTOR VARO (a script NPC, the camera cuts to him) waits at
# the top (8,1) between two pillars. A win: flag 87 (Medalla Nucleo, builtin `badge_nucleo`, the trainer card's 8th badge), the Ground disc (flag 941), his farewell (he disbands Vertice: flag 942 hides its remaining grunts).
# Entry: Ciudad Nodo's gym door, locked by a guard until the 7th badge (flag 86; the guard hides then).
@map gimnasio_nodo
@size 17 21
@interior yes
@bg 0
@fill sslab_11
@spawn door 8 19 N
@flag varo_disc 941            # the Ground disc was handed over (a full bag keeps it clear)
@flag fissure_given 692        # (contract 80): the second disc (Chasm role, Disc 31) was handed over. 692 = the pick-up flag of the pouch that lay in the Cueva Secreta 2 until contract 80
@flag vertice_gone 942         # Director Varo disbanded Team Vertice (hides its grunts in the towns)
@flag beaten_montanista_n1 943
@flag beaten_mecanico_n1 944
@flag beaten_montanista_n2 945
@flag beaten_explorador_n1 946
@flag beaten_mecanico_n2 947
@flag beaten_chica_n1 948
@flag beaten_montanista_n3 949
